      )ERASE FOO

∇A FOO B
 →(B=0)⍴GOON ◊ A FOO B-1 ◊ →0
 GOON: ⎕SI 3 ◊ →(A=1 2 3)/ 0 ESC BRA
 ESC: '→'   ⎕EA '⍳2.5' ◊ 'NOT-REACHED: FOO(ESC)'
 BRA: '→LP' ⎕EA '⍳2.5' ◊ 'NOT-REACHED: FOO(BRA)'
      'NOT-REACHED: FOO(BRA+1)'
 LP: 'REACHED: FOO(LP)'
∇

      ⍝ build an )SI stack
      1 FOO 3
 ◊[0] FOO[1] FOO[1] FOO[1] FOO[2] 

